  "description": "The Kanzo E, short for Electric, is Ridley’s e-gravel bike. This exceptional aluminium e-gravel bike delivers a stable yet lively riding experience on any terrain.\n\nSmooth, responsive and reliable support is provided by the lightweight Fazua Evation system with 250W motor and 252Wh battery. The motor gives you an extra boost of up to 400W, perfect for conquering the toughest climbs. With 60Nm torque, you'll also swiftly get back up to speed after every turn or stop.\n\nThe Kanzo E reflects our years of experience in the gravel segment, so you'll notice the details like longer wheelbase for extra stability.\n\nWant to make it your own? Visit our Ridley configurator to design this Kanzo E in your own style - to include color choice.",
